WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.923 --> 00:00:10.192
&gt;&gt;&gt; Tonight, new video just in

00:00:10.326 --> 00:00:13.529
to out front, the moment a

00:00:13.662 --> 00:00:15.865
soldier shoots a Russian jet out

00:00:15.998 --> 00:00:19.201
of the sky.

00:00:19.201 --> 00:00:21.203
Holding a sure fas to air

00:00:21.203 --> 00:00:24.507
missile launcher and fires twice

00:00:24.640 --> 00:00:26.542
and you see the entire recoil

00:00:26.675 --> 00:00:27.777
turning away and then you will

00:00:27.910 --> 00:00:30.246
see the jet's wreckage still

00:00:30.379 --> 00:00:30.579
