00:00:40.055 --> 00:00:41.624
that was destroyed and Russian

00:00:41.757 --> 00:00:42.658
fighters basically moving in

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:44.326
between homes and then, you know

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:47.663
the Ukrainians, they filmed it.

00:00:47.797 --> 00:00:49.598
The drones see it, it was

00:00:49.732 --> 00:00:51.233
spotted and you'll see the

00:00:51.233 --> 00:00:51.901
massive fireball in the

00:00:52.034 --> 00:00:53.269
neighborhood as you see.

00:00:53.402 --> 00:00:55.404
Russia's losses that they are

00:00:55.538 --> 00:00:57.239
sustaining in this way in place

00:00:57.239 --> 00:00:58.207
after place along the front line

00:00:58.340 --> 00:01:01.277
is partly why Russia is --

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:03.746
you'reeing a big ramp up in

00:01:03.879 --> 00:01:08.050
recruitment exforts anecdotally

00:01:08.184 --> 00:01:09.985
on the ground and we have video

00:01:10.119 --> 00:01:12.855
of young children being taught

00:01:13.255 --> 00:01:15.691
to be prepared to fight.

00:01:15.825 --> 00:01:24.099
These are children in annexed

00:01:24.233 --> 00:01:26.602
crimea and that girl is fast and

00:01:26.735 --> 00:01:29.271
they're learning biological

00:01:29.271 --> 00:01:31.273
training and Wagner has its own

00:01:31.273 --> 00:01:33.275
youth club in St. Petersburg and

00:01:33.275 --> 00:01:34.844
there are kids who now

00:01:35.277 --> 00:01:36.812
reportedly attend there and are

00:01:36.946 --> 00:01:38.581
able to use drone simulators,

00:01:38.714 --> 00:01:39.281
reportedly.

00:01:39.281 --> 00:01:40.883
We do see it turning to its

00:01:41.283 --> 00:01:41.684
youngest and there are

00:01:41.817 --> 00:01:42.918
recruiting efforts in schools

00:01:43.285 --> 00:01:44.820
and boys as it faces mounting

00:01:44.954 --> 00:01:46.522
losses on the battlefield.

00:01:46.655 --> 00:01:47.656
Melissa bell is out front

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:49.625
tonight.

00:01:49.758 --> 00:01:51.927
&gt;&gt; Wagner fighters at an

00:01:52.061 --> 00:01:54.597
industrial plant inside bakhmut.

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:57.466
They are making very gradual

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:00.369
advances, but at a huge cost.

00:02:00.502 --> 00:02:02.972
&gt;&gt; This soldier says Ukrainian

00:02:03.305 --> 00:02:04.506
forces have vast amounts of

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:05.674
ammunition and are heavily

00:02:05.808 --> 00:02:09.311
shelling the area.

00:02:09.311 --> 00:02:10.913
We can't even raise our heads,

00:02:11.313 --> 00:02:11.847
he says.

00:02:11.981 --> 00:02:15.317
Wagner has been trying to take

00:02:15.317 --> 00:02:16.585
bakhmut for two months and may

00:02:16.719 --> 00:02:19.588
now be running short of

00:02:19.722 --> 00:02:21.557
fighters.

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:23.325
Its boss, yevgeny prigozhin has

00:02:23.359 --> 00:02:24.560
lashed out at the Russian

00:02:24.693 --> 00:02:25.561
defense ministry for starving

00:02:25.694 --> 00:02:29.331
his men of ammunition.

00:02:29.431 --> 00:02:30.199
&gt;&gt; Translator: We need the

00:02:30.332 --> 00:02:32.134
military to shield the

00:02:32.268 --> 00:02:33.335
approaches if they manage to do

00:02:33.402 --> 00:02:34.670
so everything will be okay.

00:02:34.803 --> 00:02:37.606
If not, then Wagner will be

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:38.874
encircled together with the

00:02:39.008 --> 00:02:42.378
Ukrainians inside bakhmut.

00:02:42.511 --> 00:02:44.647
&gt;&gt; In his latest social media

00:02:44.780 --> 00:02:46.582
post, prigozhin praised honest

00:02:46.715 --> 00:02:48.784
Russian soldiers and claimed,

00:02:48.918 --> 00:02:50.319
quote, unprofessional scoundrels

00:02:50.452 --> 00:02:52.588
and intriguers crush these

00:02:52.721 --> 00:02:54.423
modest guys and begin to push

00:02:54.556 --> 00:02:57.426
them around and humiliate them.

00:02:57.559 --> 00:02:59.361
Yet another dive at the military

00:02:59.361 --> 00:03:00.329
hierarchy in Moscow.

00:03:00.462 --> 00:03:01.664
Prigozhin has accused the

00:03:01.797 --> 00:03:03.365
defense mippistry of

00:03:03.365 --> 00:03:05.367
incompetence and corruption and

00:03:05.401 --> 00:03:06.502
compared his own almost

00:03:06.635 --> 00:03:08.404
continuous present in bakhmut to

00:03:08.537 --> 00:03:14.376
the notable absence of sergei

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:16.278
shoigu.

00:03:16.412 --> 00:03:20.316
Prigozhin, once a Putin ally and

00:03:20.449 --> 00:03:21.050
nicknamed Putin's chef is a man

00:03:21.383 --> 00:03:21.650
under pressure.

00:03:21.784 --> 00:03:23.686
He recruited tens of thousands

00:03:23.819 --> 00:03:25.387
of Russian men from prisons and

00:03:25.387 --> 00:03:27.923
they've endured horrendous

00:03:28.057 --> 00:03:32.661
losses, as many as 80% in some

00:03:32.795 --> 00:03:32.962
units.

00:03:33.395 --> 00:03:34.396
He's dredging for recruits and

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:36.131
his more experienced units are

00:03:36.265 --> 00:03:38.067
stretched as they try to

00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:38.934
encircle bakhmut.

00:03:39.068 --> 00:03:40.903
Western analysts think that

00:03:41.036 --> 00:03:43.839
prigozhin has fallen into a trap

00:03:43.973 --> 00:03:44.873
laid by shoigu.

00:03:45.407 --> 00:03:47.409
A trap designed to weaken both

00:03:47.543 --> 00:03:48.477
Wagner and its boss.

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:51.914
Just when Wagner most needs the

00:03:52.047 --> 00:03:53.415
support of the Russian military

00:03:53.449 --> 00:03:56.385
around bakhmut, it's curiously

00:03:56.518 --> 00:03:56.719
absent.

00:03:56.852 --> 00:03:59.655
Russia's elite piling out the

00:03:59.788 --> 00:04:00.022
oligarch.

00:04:00.155 --> 00:04:02.992
Alexei mukin accused prigozhin

00:04:03.425 --> 00:04:04.960
of political ambitions and said

00:04:05.094 --> 00:04:07.429
he was an incompetent commander

00:04:07.463 --> 00:04:09.431
adding, he has exposed the

00:04:09.431 --> 00:04:12.634
Wagner fighters to a major rishg

00:04:12.768 --> 00:04:17.006
of encirclement from the attack.

00:04:17.439 --> 00:04:20.509
He has regarded prigozhin as

00:04:20.642 --> 00:04:22.945
Vladimir Putin's licensed

00:04:23.078 --> 00:04:24.580
disruptor and if there is an

00:04:24.713 --> 00:04:26.482
unsuccessful bid to take bakhmut

00:04:26.615 --> 00:04:28.183
he might find himself out in the

00:04:28.317 --> 00:04:28.550
cold.

00:04:28.684 --> 00:04:31.453
For now, Erin, the battle for

00:04:31.453 --> 00:04:32.921
bakhmut continues.

00:04:33.055 --> 00:04:34.556
Ukrainians saying it is too

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:35.691
early to draw conclusions one

00:04:35.824 --> 00:04:37.593
way or the other in this ongoing

00:04:37.726 --> 00:04:37.926
battle.

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:40.062
What is also unclear at this

00:04:40.195 --> 00:04:41.463
stage is what happens with the

00:04:41.463 --> 00:04:42.798
battle within the battle and

00:04:42.931 --> 00:04:44.600
whether yevgeny prigozhin can

00:04:44.733 --> 00:04:46.435
come out unscathed.

00:04:46.568 --> 00:04:46.735
Erin?

00:04:46.869 --> 00:04:47.469
&gt;&gt; Melissa, thank you very much

00:04:47.603 --> 00:04:48.437
from Ukraine.

00:04:48.570 --> 00:04:53.475
Out front now, major general

00:04:53.475 --> 00:04:54.309
James "Spider" marks.

00:04:54.443 --> 00:04:56.545
Can Putin afford to let the

00:04:56.678 --> 00:04:58.047
Wagner group totally fail?

00:04:58.180 --> 00:04:59.481
&gt;&gt; No, he can't.

00:04:59.548 --> 00:05:00.816
He doesn't want them to fail.

00:05:00.949 --> 00:05:04.319
I tell you, Melissa's report was

00:05:04.453 --> 00:05:06.688
really phenomenal, the levels of

00:05:06.822 --> 00:05:08.390
detail and the analysis and the

00:05:08.524 --> 00:05:10.993
relationships and the

00:05:11.126 --> 00:05:13.495
interknifing and fighting that

00:05:13.629 --> 00:05:16.331
ostensibly takes place within

00:05:16.465 --> 00:05:18.700
Putin's hierarchy.

00:05:18.834 --> 00:05:19.501
It's not frightening.

00:05:19.568 --> 00:05:21.503
It's to be expected, I guess.

00:05:21.503 --> 00:05:23.806
It's a imga of thrones kind of

00:05:23.939 --> 00:05:24.239
environment.

00:05:24.373 --> 00:05:25.874
Putin can't afford to lose the

00:05:26.008 --> 00:05:27.643
Wagner group, and I will tell

00:05:27.776 --> 00:05:30.446
you, if he were to lose

00:05:30.579 --> 00:05:31.513
prigozhin someone else would

00:05:31.513 --> 00:05:33.148
step up and they'd be recruited

00:05:33.515 --> 00:05:35.651
in and that individual would go

00:05:35.784 --> 00:05:38.253
about the business of creating a

00:05:38.387 --> 00:05:39.521
contract force not unlike the

00:05:39.521 --> 00:05:39.955
Wagner group.

00:05:40.089 --> 00:05:41.523
The money exists and they'll

00:05:41.523 --> 00:05:42.858
find the recruits and they're

00:05:42.991 --> 00:05:43.826
going to pay folks.

00:05:43.959 --> 00:05:45.961
They have the money to buy the

00:05:46.095 --> 00:05:47.529
kit and the individuals and that

00:05:47.529 --> 00:05:48.430
doesn't mean they have the

00:05:48.564 --> 00:05:48.931
training.

00:05:49.064 --> 00:05:51.600
So I think Putin's got himself a

00:05:51.733 --> 00:05:54.470
legitimate problem here having

00:05:54.603 --> 00:05:56.772
much freedom into prigozhin's

00:05:56.905 --> 00:05:57.539
hand.

00:05:57.539 --> 00:05:58.640
&gt;&gt; You know what's interesting?

00:05:58.774 --> 00:06:01.543
I spoke to a Ukrainian soldier

00:06:01.543 --> 00:06:03.545
in bakhmut and he told us

00:06:03.545 --> 00:06:05.114
something he heard about and it

00:06:05.547 --> 00:06:06.548
still sort of stuns to imagine

00:06:06.682 --> 00:06:09.551
that the Wagner forces literally

00:06:09.651 --> 00:06:12.054
run into machine gun fire and

00:06:12.187 --> 00:06:14.123
they die en masse.

00:06:14.256 --> 00:06:15.124
Here's what he said.

00:06:15.557 --> 00:06:17.559
&gt;&gt; I can't believe that people,

00:06:17.593 --> 00:06:22.231
a real person can run without

00:06:22.364 --> 00:06:26.502
afraid to die, without no

00:06:26.635 --> 00:06:27.836
recitation and they see the

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:28.937
fellows falling down and they

00:06:29.071 --> 00:06:32.574
continue running.

00:06:32.708 --> 00:06:33.575
Wagner have only -- only one

00:06:33.575 --> 00:06:35.577
chance to survive is to take our

00:06:35.677 --> 00:06:36.879
position, our trenches.

00:06:37.012 --> 00:06:38.280
That's all.

00:06:38.413 --> 00:06:40.149
They have no choice to return to

00:06:40.282 --> 00:06:41.984
the position because they will

00:06:42.117 --> 00:06:45.587
be killed from their fellows.

00:06:45.621 --> 00:06:47.589
&gt;&gt; I mean, it is amazing to hear

00:06:47.589 --> 00:06:49.758
him say it, right?

00:06:49.892 --> 00:06:51.226
That, you know, and then I

00:06:51.593 --> 00:06:52.961
realized the key to their

00:06:53.095 --> 00:06:54.730
success because they can't turn

00:06:54.863 --> 00:06:55.063
around.

00:06:55.197 --> 00:06:57.599
They know they're going to die.

00:06:57.599 --> 00:06:58.834
So their best shot is to run

00:06:58.967 --> 00:07:00.369
into machine gun fire.

00:07:00.502 --> 00:07:01.270
&gt;&gt; Yeah.

00:07:01.603 --> 00:07:03.605
There is a distinct difference

00:07:03.672 --> 00:07:04.907
between a Ukrainian soldier who

00:07:05.040 --> 00:07:06.875
is fighting for the sovereignty

00:07:07.009 --> 00:07:09.845
and Independence of his nation

00:07:09.978 --> 00:07:11.113
and the Russian conscripted and

00:07:11.246 --> 00:07:14.850
the contracted Wagner group

00:07:14.983 --> 00:07:15.250
individual.

00:07:15.617 --> 00:07:17.619
Russian -- I'm sorry, the

00:07:17.619 --> 00:07:19.621
Ukrainian soldier is going to

00:07:19.621 --> 00:07:21.123
fight for his buddies.

00:07:21.256 --> 00:07:22.991
He's fighting for his

00:07:23.125 --> 00:07:23.659
organization.

00:07:23.792 --> 00:07:24.760
He's fighting for those on his

00:07:24.893 --> 00:07:26.595
left and his right and that

00:07:26.728 --> 00:07:27.996
individual is more frightened

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:29.631
about letting them down than he

00:07:29.631 --> 00:07:32.668
is potentially dying in combat.

00:07:32.801 --> 00:07:35.871
The ones that are working for

00:07:36.004 --> 00:07:36.738
Wagner know that the end state

00:07:36.872 --> 00:07:38.273
will be death of some sort so

00:07:38.407 --> 00:07:39.641
they really don't care.

00:07:39.641 --> 00:07:41.643
They are frightened of dying,

00:07:41.643 --> 00:07:46.648
but they are more frightened to

00:07:46.782 --> 00:07:48.217
be shot in the head if they are

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:48.850
to return.

00:07:48.984 --> 00:07:52.020
You have professional soldiers,

00:07:52.154 --> 00:07:53.655
vis-a-vis, the conscripted

00:07:53.689 --> 00:07:55.157
killers with no motivation other

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:58.026
than the threat from a boss,

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.928
effectless, horrible leadership.

00:08:00.062 --> 00:08:01.663
They're going to end their lives

00:08:01.697 --> 00:08:03.665
one way or the other so they

00:08:03.732 --> 00:08:04.499
have no choice.

00:08:04.633 --> 00:08:05.701
&gt;&gt; That's just stunning.

00:08:05.834 --> 00:08:07.669
&gt;&gt; It really is just incredible

